# PLUSIND (General Description). 1 is added to the position reference in
# TS 27, e.g. DL 7, 9 becomes DL 7, 10, but DL 7, 32 becomes DL 8, 1.
#
# The report gives this description and no table. This table is ours.
# TS 2, 4, 5 and 6 are altered.
PLUSIND
  1   TS 27 - TS 2
  3   ADD 'A'
  4   PLUSIND 20 - TS 2
  6   ADD
  7   TS 4 - TS 6
  8   TS 6 - TS 27
  9   B, UNBURY
# A pulse in digit 18: one minor cycle on.
 20   0000,0000,0000,0000,0100,0000,0000,0000
